# Prettier formats the TypeScript port's own files: sources, tests and their
# configuration. Everything below is either kept byte for byte (test projects,
# golden files, pinned upstream configs and data, the in-container helpers) or
# not part of the port (docs and workflows).
**/testdata/
internal/checks/config/
internal/checks/data/
internal/checks/js/
internal/schema/
internal/toolset/npm/
.claude/
.github/
*.md
*.yml
*.yaml
